WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.083
P7.1 · The board pack and why it calculates nothing

2
00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:08.972
The board pack calculates nothing of its own.

3
00:00:09.022 --> 00:00:13.747
So its figures always match the screens. A wrong figure is fixed upstream.

4
00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:21.448
On the P&L, the board pack view shows the last closing against budget and against the prior month.

5
00:00:21.498 --> 00:00:25.258
The same figures as the statement, on one page for the board.

6
00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:30.623
